          "document(action="lookup", id=...) may hit the same short indexing delay right after create; MCP retries briefly and then returns a timing-specific hint if indexing still has not settled.",
        ],
        "hint": "Use a notebook ID and optionally pass app for downstream SiYuan event routing. When the user asks for a diary, journal entry, daily log, or today’s note in a notebook, prefer this action over manually creating a path and then appending content.",
