        "hint": "Use a concrete deckID + cardID + rating, or pass skip=true to skip. Resolve deckID/cardID through list_cards or get_cards first; empty deckID is rejected. reviewedCards is optional; each entry must include cardID because SiYuan only reads reviewedCards[].cardID.",
