        "hint": "Use a human-readable document path. Returns an AI-editable Markdown window made only of complete display blocks. Continue with nextWindow or blockStart/blockLimit/tokenBudget; page/pageSize character pagination was removed. The response includes a full heading outline, and includeBlockIds=true adds a sidecar blockRefs mapping without polluting content. When complex SiYuan blocks are detected, use block.dom, file.export_md, av, or other advanced tools for inspection and editing.",
