        "hint": "Searches SiYuan’s native embedding index by meaning. Requires SiYuan 3.7.0+ and an enabled, indexed embedding model. Supports paths, types/typeShortcodes, subTypes, page, and pageSize; encrypted notebooks are not included in the native embedding index.",
