    "description": "🖥️ Grouped system and notification operations. Use the "action" field to select the operation.

Common actions: conf, changelog, get_version, get_current_time. Required fields: conf: no additional fields; changelog: no additional fields; get_version: no additional fields; get_current_time: no additional fields.

Additional actions: workspace_info, network, notify, perform_sync. Read siyuan://help/action/system/{action} for details, or call action="help" if resources are unavailable.

Parameter contract per action (fields outside the action's optional list should not be sent):
system.workspace_info: required [] | optional []
system.network: required [] | optional []
system.conf: required [] | optional [mode, keyPath, maxDepth, maxItems]
system.notify: required [msg, level] | optional [timeout]
system.changelog: required [] | optional [version, fromVersion, limit, includeRaw]
system.perform_sync: required [] | optional []
system.get_version: required [] | optional []
system.get_current_time: required [] | optional []

Most system actions in this tool are read-only; perform_sync is the mutating exception and requires explicit user confirmation before execution. system(action="workspace_info") exposes the workspace path and is high-risk; it is disabled by default. Requires user confirmation before: workspace_info, perform_sync.",
    "overview": {
      "actionSummaries": {
        "changelog": "Reads the bundled plugin CHANGELOG with structured personalizationReview hints. Pass fromVersion after upgrades, version for one exact entry, or includeRaw=true for Markdown.",
        "conf": "Defaults to a navigable summary. Use mode="get" with keyPath to read one config field or subtree at a time, e.g. conf.appearance.mode or conf.langs[0].",
        "get_current_time": "Returns the current system time as {currentTime} epoch milliseconds and {iso} ISO 8601 text.",
        "get_version": "Returns the current SiYuan version as {version}.",
        "network": "Returns masked proxy information only.",
        "notify": "Show an info or error notification in the SiYuan UI. Optional timeout is in milliseconds.",
        "perform_sync": "Triggers SiYuan sync immediately through /api/sync/performSync. This action can change local and remote sync state and requires explicit user confirmation.",
        "workspace_info": "Returns workspace path metadata and current SiYuan version. High-risk: leaks the absolute workspace path; disabled by default and requires explicit user confirmation.",
      },
      "actions": {
        "changelog": {
          "hint": "Reads the bundled plugin CHANGELOG with structured personalizationReview hints. Pass fromVersion after upgrades, version for one exact entry, or includeRaw=true for Markdown.",
          "requiresConfirmation": false,
